
@host = https://localhost:7233

### 1. OfficerService Health Test
GET {{host}}/health


### 2. Validate Officer Account
### Requires Admin JWT
POST {{host}}/api/officers/validate-create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nimal Perera",
  "email": "officer@example.com",
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 3. Create Officer Account
### Requires Admin JWT
POST {{host}}/api/officers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nimal Perera",
  "email": "officer@example.com",
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 4. Get Officer Profile
### Requires Officer JWT
GET {{host}}/api/officers/me


### 5. Test Invalid Officer Registration
### Requires Admin JWT
POST {{host}}/api/officers/validate-create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nimal Perera",
  "email": "officer@example.com",
  "contact": "123",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 6. Officer Login - Valid Format
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 7. Officer Login - Invalid Mobile
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "123",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 8. Officer Login - Empty Password
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "password": ""
}


### 9. Verify OTP - Valid Format
POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "otp": "123456"
}


### 10. Verify OTP - Invalid Format
POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "otp": "123"
}


### 11. Resend OTP
POST {{host}}/api/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567"
}


### 12. Resend OTP - Invalid Mobile
POST {{host}}/api/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "123"
}



### 20. Get Assigned Requests for Verification
GET https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/requests


### 21. Get Request Review Details
GET https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/requests/1


### 22. Get Quotations for Verification
GET https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/quotations


### 23. Get Quotation Review Details
GET https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/quotations/1


### 24. Get Compliance Checklists
GET https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/checklists


### 25. Approve Supply Request
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/requests/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approved",
  "passedCheckIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "note": "All compliance requirements satisfied."
}


### 26. Reject Supply Request
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/requests/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Rejected",
  "passedCheckIds": [1],
  "note": "Requested quantity is not suitable."
}


### 27. Approve Supplier Quotation
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/quotations/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approved",
  "passedCheckIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "note": "Price, stock and delivery are acceptable."
}


### 28. Reject Supplier Quotation
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/quotations/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Rejected",
  "passedCheckIds": [1, 3],
  "note": "Supplier stock is insufficient."
}


### 29. Test Approval with Incomplete Checklist
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/requests/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Approved",
  "passedCheckIds": [1, 2],
  "note": ""
}


### 30. Test Rejection without Note
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/quotations/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Rejected",
  "passedCheckIds": [1],
  "note": ""
}


### 31. Test Invalid Decision
POST https://localhost:7233/api/verifications/requests/1/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Cancelled",
  "passedCheckIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "note": ""
}


  
