Access-Control-Request-Method: GET
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization




@officerHost = https://localhost:7233

### Get All Guidelines
GET https://localhost:7233/api/guidelines


### Get Latest 4 Guidelines
GET https://localhost:7233/api/guidelines

### Get Guideline By ID
GET {{officerHost}}/api/guidelines/1


### Publish Guideline
### Requires valid Officer JWT
POST {{officerHost}}/api/guidelines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Organic Farming",
  "text": "Use sustainable farming practices."
}


### Edit Guideline
### Requires valid Officer JWT
PUT {{officerHost}}/api/guidelines/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Organic Farming Guidelines",
  "text": "Use compost and environmentally friendly methods."
}


### Delete Guideline
### Requires valid Officer JWT
DELETE {{officerHost}}/api/guidelines/1


### Invalid Guideline Limit
GET {{officerHost}}/api/guidelines?limit=0